# Copy to ops/watchdog.env (gitignored) and fill in.
#
# Dead-man heartbeat for the collector watchdog:
#   1. Sign up free at https://healthchecks.io
#   2. Create a check named "alphaforge-collector", period 5 min, grace 15 min
#   3. Paste its ping URL here
# The watchdog pings this URL every 5 minutes while healthy; healthchecks.io
# emails/notifies you if pings stop (machine dead) or a /fail ping arrives
# (collector unhealthy).
HEALTHCHECKS_URL=""
